## What We Solve

Many engineering, property, and logistics teams still rely heavily on WhatsApp groups for daily coordination. Messages, voice notes, images, and documents are scattered across conversations — making it time-consuming to find a specific decision or file.

## What's New in the Official Release

- **Conversation organisation**: Automatically structures group content by topic and time
- **Voice transcription**: Supports Cantonese and English voice notes
- **Document extraction**: Pulls key fields from images and PDFs
- **Export reports**: Generate shareable project records in one click

## Who Is This For

If your team coordinates project progress, handles client enquiries, or manages frontline reporting via WhatsApp, WhatsApp AI Agent can turn those conversations into actionable operational data.

> Want to see if your workflow is a good fit? [Contact us](/en/contact/) to schedule a 30-minute workflow review.
